  ],
  "slug": "my-bedroom",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/20651_my-bedroom.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "My bedroom is small, but I like it very much. There is a large bed in the middle of the bedroom, a desk beside the bed, and a chair in front of the desk. On the other side of the bed is a wardrobe and bookshelf. The bookshelf is filled with my favorite books. Sitting in front of the window and reading every night is my happiest time. The bedroom walls are green and the curtains are green. That's my favorite color. There are my paintings and flowers on the desk. They are so beautiful."
  ],
  "english_full": "My bedroom is small, but I like it very much. There is a large bed in the middle of the bedroom, a desk beside the bed, and a chair in front of the desk. On the other side of the bed is a wardrobe and bookshelf. The bookshelf is filled with my favorite books. Sitting in front of the window and reading every night is my happiest time. The bedroom walls are green and the curtains are green. That's my favorite color. There are my paintings and flowers on the desk. They are so beautiful.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Моя спа́льня ма́ленькая, но я её о́чень лю́блю. В сре́дине спа́льни стои́т большо́я крова́ть, рядом с крова́тью находитс́я би́ржу, а пе́ред би́ржей ста́л стул. На друго́й сторо́не крова́ти - гардеро́б и кни́жная по́лка. Кни́жная по́лка запо́лнена моими люби́мыми кни́гами. Присев пе́ред око́ном и чита́я ка́ждую ночь, я наи́более сча́стлив. Стены в спа́льне зе́лёные, а капу́т тоже зе́лёный. Это мой люби́мый цвет. На би́рже лежат мои карти́ны и цветы́. Они о́чень краси́вые."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Moya spályn' málen'kaya, no ya yeyo óchen' lyúblyu. V sréddinee spályn' stoit bol'shóya krevát', ryádom s krevát'yu nakhodit'sya bírzhú, a péred bírzhé stál stul. Na drugóy storóně krevát'i - garderób i knízh’naya pólka. Knízh’naya pólka zapólnena móimi lyubí-mými knígamí. Prisésév péred okónm i chitáya káz'duyu nóch', ya naiból’ shchástliv. Stény v spályně zelé-nyé, a kapút tozhe zelé-ny. Éto moy lyubí-myy tsévt. Na bírzhé lezhát mói kartíný i tsvéty. Ony óchen' krásivyy."
  ],
