      "id": "story_20651_p0_c0",
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 0,
      "text": "Моя спа́льня ма́ленькая, но я её о́чень лю́блю.",
      "text_en": "My bedroom is small, but I like it very much.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Moya\" data-defn=\"моя\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">Моя</span><rt>Moya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"spál&#x27;nya\" data-defn=\"спальня\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">спа́льня</span><rt>spál&#x27;nya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"málen&#x27;kaya\" data-defn=\"маленькая\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">ма́ленькая</span><rt>málen&#x27;kaya</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"no\" data-defn=\"но\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">но</span><rt>no</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ya\" data-defn=\"я\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">я</span><rt>ya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"eyo\" data-defn=\"её\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">её</span><rt>eyo</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"óchen&#x27;\" data-defn=\"очень\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">о́чень</span><rt>óchen&#x27;</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lyúblyu\" data-defn=\"люблю\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">лю́блю</span><rt>lyúblyu</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "Moya spál'nya málen'kaya, no ya eyo óchen' lyúblyu.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.76,
      "duration": 2.76
    },
    {
      "id": "story_20651_p0_c1",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "text": "В сре́дине спа́льни стои́т большо́я крова́ть, рядом с крова́тью находитс́я би́ржу, а пе́ред би́ржей ста́л стул.",
      "text_en": "There is a large bed in the middle of the bedroom, a desk beside the bed, and a chair in front of the desk.",
