 class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"stál\" data-defn=\"стал\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">ста́л</span><rt>stál</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"stul\" data-defn=\"стул\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">стул</span><rt>stul</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "V srédine spál'ni stoít bol'shóya krovát', ryadom s krovát'yu nakhoditśya bírzhu, a péred bírzhey stál stul.",
      "start": 3.11,
      "end": 8.69,
      "duration": 5.58
    },
